
---

### 📄 .gitignore

```gitignore
# Byte-compiled / optimized files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual environments
venv/
env/
.venv/
ENV/

# IDE settings
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs and databases
*.log
*.sqlite3

# Environment variables
.env

# Task data file – keep your local tasks out of version control if you wish
# text1.txt